WEBVTT

00:00:05.693 --> 00:00:07.612
Mmm, smells so good!

00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:09.822
I wonder what's for dinner tonight?

00:00:10.031 --> 00:00:12.075
Hey, Rin, are you done yet?

00:00:12.116 --> 00:00:14.202
Don't be so impatient.

00:00:15.286 --> 00:00:16.871
Okay, it's ready!

00:00:17.705 --> 00:00:20.917
Ta-da! We're having sukiyaki tonight!

00:00:23.002 --> 00:00:24.796
Meat! Meat!

00:00:24.921 --> 00:00:28.716
Yukio says he's stuck working,
so let's eat first!

00:00:33.805 --> 00:00:35.181
Here! This is for you!

00:00:35.348 --> 00:00:36.975
Thanks, Rin!

00:00:37.016 --> 00:00:39.102
Time to eat!

00:00:41.020 --> 00:00:42.146
HOT!!!

00:00:42.272 --> 00:00:43.690
Hot! Hot, hot, hot!

00:00:44.399 --> 00:00:47.360
I knew you couldn't handle hot food.

00:00:48.736 --> 00:00:50.947
While you're griping about how hot it is,

00:00:50.989 --> 00:00:53.658
I'm gonna gobble up the whole pot!

00:00:56.244 --> 00:00:58.413
Mmm... so good!

00:01:01.624 --> 00:01:04.127
You'd better hurry,
or there won't be any left!

00:01:04.544 --> 00:01:05.545
How could you!

00:01:05.628 --> 00:01:08.256
You're so mean, Rin!
I hate you!

00:01:08.298 --> 00:01:09.632
Hey! Kuro?

00:01:12.260 --> 00:01:13.803
They've multiplied again.

00:01:15.054 --> 00:01:16.472
Yukio!

00:01:17.390 --> 00:01:21.394
Go yell at Rin for me!
The way you always do - BAM!

00:01:21.894 --> 00:01:24.272
Hey, Kuro, you shouldn't interrupt people.

00:01:24.314 --> 00:01:27.025
L-Listen to what I'm saying!

00:01:28.234 --> 00:01:31.738
By the way, Kuro, there's no sign
of you ever having used that...

00:01:32.238 --> 00:01:34.699
Don't tell me you've been doing it
all over the place...

00:01:35.074 --> 00:01:38.202
What's this all of a sudden?
You really are rude!

00:01:38.286 --> 00:01:41.122
Since you're here,
why don't we practice a bit?

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.000
Okay, come on over here.

00:01:44.292 --> 00:01:47.503
No way. I've got my own
favorite spot for that!

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:53.009
Listen, Kuro, as your owners we have
a responsibility to clean up your poop.

00:01:53.134 --> 00:01:54.969
Who said you were my owner?

00:01:55.303 --> 00:01:56.971
Do as I say, Kuro!

00:01:57.055 --> 00:01:58.514
I'm not your pet!

00:01:59.057 --> 00:02:00.391
I guess I have no choice, then.

00:02:00.475 --> 00:02:02.769
You just don't get it at all!

00:02:06.189 --> 00:02:07.357
You disappoint me.

00:02:07.398 --> 00:02:09.692
I'm disappointed in you!

00:02:09.734 --> 00:02:10.777
Kuro!

00:02:13.488 --> 00:02:18.159
I can't take it here anymore.
I'm going off on a journey.

00:02:20.119 --> 00:02:29.045
BLUE EXORCIST

00:02:29.337 --> 00:02:32.340
Sei wo uke sorezore ga jinsei wo ouka
Each of us is born and enjoys life

00:02:32.715 --> 00:02:35.051
Nou no BLACK BOX wo shiru sore wa kou ka? Is it
lucky to find a black box in our brain, or not?

00:02:35.343 --> 00:02:37.512
You wa LIMIT LINE wo subete ryouga So,
we will go beyond all the limit lines

00:02:37.887 --> 00:02:40.515
Saa ikouka fumidasu sore wa kyou da And let's go.
Today is the clay when we should step forward

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:45.853
Yappa hibi wa ikansen kou sotsunaku konashitecha NO
NO You can't spend every clay just getting by- NO NO

00:02:46.145 --> 00:02:50.983
STOP nagare wo mikiwame na mazu monotomo sezu ikouze Stop
and find out where the flow is. Let's go without hesitation

00:02:51.275 --> 00:02:56.072
Todokanu mono ya kagiriaru mono ni
If you are restraining yourfeefings

00:02:56.364 --> 00:03:00.576
Atsuku naru mune wo osae tsukeru no wa
for something unreachable or limited,

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:06.082
Rikai n10 sezu osae tsukeyouto shitekita
You're just the same as those adults who tried

00:03:06.374 --> 00:03:09.669
Ano otonatachi to onaji jannka yo to
suppress you without understanding.

00:03:10.044 --> 00:03:14.757
Doushitatte kanawanai esoragoto darou ga Even
though it is an unattainable, empty wish,

00:03:15.091 --> 00:03:19.470
Mune wo moyasu hi wa darenimo keseya shinai no one
can extinguish the burning fire in your heart.

00:03:19.846 --> 00:03:24.517
Sora kara furu kuroi ame ga konomi nurashi furiyamanaku tomo Even
if the black rain falling from the sky continues to drench me

00:03:24.892 --> 00:03:30.273
Mada ore wa kawareru jibun de kaete miseru I
can change, and I can do it by my own will

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:35.111
Korega sou "PRIDE" sorezore no basho de... This is
"the pride" that we all have in our own space...

00:03:35.403 --> 00:03:39.782
Mada mada kieruna kokoro no hi wo Don't
put out the fire in your heart yet

00:03:40.116 --> 00:03:45.496
Mada mada ikeruzo ikeruzo
We can keep going further, further

00:03:50.334 --> 00:03:54.088
SPECIAL EXTRA EPISODE
KURO RUNS AWAY FROM HOME

00:03:57.008 --> 00:03:59.552
Time to eat!

00:03:59.844 --> 00:04:02.263
Huh? Hey, come back here!

00:04:02.722 --> 00:04:05.558
Oh... My dinner!

00:04:10.104 --> 00:04:11.814
It was a dream, huh?

00:04:20.740 --> 00:04:22.283
If I remember right,

00:04:22.325 --> 00:04:25.203
this girl is Rin's friend,
and went down to the beach with us.

00:04:31.209 --> 00:04:35.588
What's the matter, baby Kuro?
Are you a lost little kitty?

00:04:36.255 --> 00:04:40.009
Or are you all tuckered out
after your morning walk?

00:04:40.009 --> 00:04:42.261
Ugh, just listen to that wheedling voice!

00:04:42.345 --> 00:04:44.430
Awww, so cute!
You're such a cute kitty!

00:04:45.848 --> 00:04:47.391
Oh! Stop... Ahhh!

00:04:49.644 --> 00:04:54.190
H-Hey, don't insult me! I'm one hundred
and twenty-one years old, you know!

00:04:54.273 --> 00:04:55.983
Good morning, Izumo!

00:04:56.692 --> 00:04:59.028
Oh, you've been playing with Kuro.

00:04:59.153 --> 00:05:01.656
I-I was just tying my shoelace, that's all!

00:05:01.864 --> 00:05:06.035
As if I'd ever give the time of day
to Rin Okumura's familiar!

00:05:07.453 --> 00:05:08.412
Come on, let's go!

00:05:10.331 --> 00:05:12.708
What was that all about?

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:17.088
I'm so hungry...

00:05:20.466 --> 00:05:22.134
Huh? Kuro!

00:05:24.428 --> 00:05:26.639
Please give me something good to eat!

00:05:26.722 --> 00:05:31.310
Aren't you Rin's familiar?
Wow! You're really cute!

00:05:32.228 --> 00:05:34.063
Hey, come here!

00:05:34.272 --> 00:05:37.441
Not that... I want food...

00:05:37.775 --> 00:05:39.443
Yo, what is that thing?

00:05:39.485 --> 00:05:42.488
Oh, didn't you know, Bon?

00:05:42.697 --> 00:05:45.825
Koneko's been carrying around
his own personal cat tickler...

00:05:45.992 --> 00:05:48.661
so he can start playing right away
with any cat he runs into.

00:05:49.036 --> 00:05:50.496
He's that into it?

00:05:51.581 --> 00:05:53.416
Please let go of it!

00:05:54.542 --> 00:05:57.837
- Hey, don't bite it!
- Konekomaru! We're gonna be late!

00:05:58.212 --> 00:06:00.548
Okay, let's play another time, Kuro.

00:06:00.756 --> 00:06:06.554
Aww, Rin's so lucky! I wonder if
I can get a Cat Sidhe to be my familiar, too.

00:06:06.679 --> 00:06:08.139
You really have
a thing for cats, huh?

00:06:08.222 --> 00:06:10.057
You can tell by his name,
"Konekomaru... (Kitty-maru)"

00:06:12.268 --> 00:06:15.479
All that running around
made me even hungrier.

00:06:24.363 --> 00:06:26.991
It's not time to eat yet?

00:06:30.161 --> 00:06:33.289
This isn't gonna fill me up at all!

00:06:33.372 --> 00:06:35.666
Ugh, I'm so hot!

00:06:36.459 --> 00:06:39.462
How can I wear these
in this summer heat?

00:06:42.673 --> 00:06:45.509
- That guy... I've seen him before...
- Ups-a-daisy!

00:06:45.885 --> 00:06:48.554
He's really got guts,
ditching class like that.

00:06:50.556 --> 00:06:53.392
A-A guy with boobs?

00:06:56.395 --> 00:06:59.106
"Here it descends,
and to him it shall return."

00:07:01.692 --> 00:07:03.569
What the heck is that?

00:07:03.694 --> 00:07:06.447
TRUE CROSS BEER

00:07:07.198 --> 00:07:09.116
Man, that's delish!

00:07:09.325 --> 00:07:11.452
Nothing hits the spot
like this in the summer!

00:07:11.577 --> 00:07:15.414
Could it be that I'm so hungry
my eyes are playing tricks on me?

00:07:17.917 --> 00:07:19.418
Huh? Who's there?

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:22.713
A Cat Sidhe, huh?

00:07:23.005 --> 00:07:26.676
Humph! Well, since my cover's blown,
I have no choice!

00:07:26.926 --> 00:07:28.719
Devour the Eight Princesses...

00:07:28.928 --> 00:07:30.388
Sever the serpent!

00:07:33.140 --> 00:07:36.352
I can't reveal who
I really am just yet, you see.

00:07:36.435 --> 00:07:38.354
Sorry, but I'll have to eliminate you!

00:07:38.396 --> 00:07:40.231
No!

00:07:43.275 --> 00:07:47.071
I thought I was a goner...
But why?

00:07:51.742 --> 00:07:55.121
Oh... So she doesn't like dogs.

00:07:55.162 --> 00:07:56.580
Thank goodness!

00:07:56.956 --> 00:08:00.584
Now then, I shall relieve
the weariness of walking right here.

00:08:01.794 --> 00:08:04.672
Ah, now this is a midsummer pleasure!

00:08:04.797 --> 00:08:07.425
All signs of this mortal world
are swept away without a trace,

00:08:07.466 --> 00:08:10.261
and it feels as though
I am melting into heaven and earth!

00:08:18.477 --> 00:08:21.147
That guy seems really familiar to me, too...

00:08:22.815 --> 00:08:24.734
I wonder if he'll give me anything...

00:08:26.318 --> 00:08:27.570
Um...

00:08:28.195 --> 00:08:31.365
If a noisy noise annoys an onion,
an annoying noisy noise annoys an onion more.

00:08:31.490 --> 00:08:35.911
A skunk sat on a a stump and thunk the stump stunk,
but the stump thunk the skunk stunk.

00:08:35.995 --> 00:08:38.497
Gobbling gargoyles gobbled gobbling goblins.
Gobbling gargoyles gobbled gobbling goblins.

00:08:38.581 --> 00:08:40.499
Six sleek swans swam swiftly southward.

00:08:40.583 --> 00:08:42.543
Huh? I can hear a voice...
Six sleek swans swam swiftly southward.

00:08:42.543 --> 00:08:44.587
Huh? I can hear a voice... Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled
peppers, How many pickled peppers did Peter Piper pick?

00:08:44.587 --> 00:08:48.257
What? Who? Where? Peter Piper picked a peck of pickled
peppers, How many pickled peppers did Peter Piper pick?

00:08:48.257 --> 00:08:51.302
She sells sea shells by the sea shore.
The shells she sells are surely seashells.

00:08:51.552 --> 00:08:53.345
A Tudor who tooted a flute tried
to tutor two tooters to toot.

00:08:53.429 --> 00:08:54.847
Said the two to their tutor, "Is it harder to toot
or to tutor two tooters to toot?"

00:08:54.972 --> 00:08:58.851
Three gray geese in the green grass grazing.
Gray were the geese and green was the grass.

00:08:58.934 --> 00:09:02.188
Swan swam over the sea.
Swim, swan, swim!

00:09:02.271 --> 00:09:06.901
Swan swam back again.
Well swum, swan!

00:09:07.234 --> 00:09:09.820
What's up with this guy? Scary!

00:09:09.862 --> 00:09:13.574
How many cans can a canner can,
if a canner can can cans?

00:09:16.786 --> 00:09:19.330
Please give me something to eat.
I don't care what it is.

00:09:19.705 --> 00:09:22.917
Hey, there's a tuna sandwich left.
I'd like to have that.

00:09:23.042 --> 00:09:25.336
No, I don't mind something else.

00:09:25.419 --> 00:09:29.215
Huh? What a pesky cat. Shush!

00:09:32.259 --> 00:09:34.470
I am hungry!

00:09:35.262 --> 00:09:36.430
Kuro?

00:09:37.848 --> 00:09:39.683
It's Rin's friend.

00:09:40.893 --> 00:09:42.394
Hello!

00:09:42.561 --> 00:09:43.979
What's the matter, Kuro?

00:09:44.021 --> 00:09:47.066
This girl smells so good!

00:09:48.818 --> 00:09:53.405
You're a hungry cat, aren't you? Okay, come
to my house, and I'll make you something.

00:09:54.323 --> 00:09:56.534
You mean you understand me?

00:09:58.077 --> 00:09:59.078
Now, now...

00:09:59.161 --> 00:10:02.081
FUTSUMA-YA

00:10:02.456 --> 00:10:05.334
Here you go!
Herb stew and herb cookies!

00:10:08.546 --> 00:10:11.757
Herb stew and herb cookies?

00:10:12.174 --> 00:10:14.510
Are these really meant to be eaten?

00:10:14.927 --> 00:10:18.639
Today they turned out much,
much better than usual.

00:10:18.722 --> 00:10:22.601
I don't know about the taste,
but it's got to be good for you.

00:10:24.061 --> 00:10:26.313
Okay, go on and eat!

00:10:27.731 --> 00:10:30.025
Oh, that's right - sorry!

00:10:30.109 --> 00:10:31.610
I didn't realize...

00:10:34.488 --> 00:10:36.490
Open up and say ah!

00:10:43.998 --> 00:10:44.957
Kuro?

00:10:46.792 --> 00:10:50.588
That was so awful,
it didn't taste like it was from this planet!

00:11:00.097 --> 00:11:02.766
Man, it's another scorcher today, huh?

00:11:02.850 --> 00:11:04.852
Yeah, but they say
it's gonna rain tonight.

00:11:04.977 --> 00:11:07.438
I hope that means it's gonna
cool down a little.

00:11:07.521 --> 00:11:09.231
I hope so, too!

00:11:13.777 --> 00:11:15.529
Good job, Kuro.

00:11:16.655 --> 00:11:19.450
I wonder if he remembers me.

00:11:19.658 --> 00:11:21.744
All righty, let's go!

00:11:25.581 --> 00:11:27.666
Shiro would never die!

00:11:28.334 --> 00:11:30.753
Shiro will come back!

00:11:36.383 --> 00:11:38.928
Kuro? Hey, Kuro!

00:11:39.428 --> 00:11:42.765
I have nowhere to go anymore...

00:11:44.558 --> 00:11:48.062
Why did you have to die, Shiro?

00:11:48.854 --> 00:11:53.025
<i>1 want to see Shire...
1 want to see him'.!</i>

00:11:56.695 --> 00:12:01.116
I know! I should just go
see Shiro myself!

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:16.423
I've never gone to see
Shiro by myself before.

00:12:16.882 --> 00:12:19.009
When Rin took me to see him,

00:12:19.468 --> 00:12:21.720
I think we took the train...

00:12:24.348 --> 00:12:25.349
Octopus!

00:12:28.727 --> 00:12:31.647
Hey, there's a whole
bunch on the ground!

00:12:33.732 --> 00:12:37.152
Mmm, these Fried Bombs
really are the bomb!

00:12:37.903 --> 00:12:41.657
The best thing about them is that
you can enjoy all sorts of different fillings.

00:12:43.867 --> 00:12:46.328
What kind of filling
should I choose next?

00:12:47.204 --> 00:12:48.747
I-I'm gonna be eaten!

00:12:52.918 --> 00:12:53.794
Elder Brother...

00:12:53.919 --> 00:12:57.172
Amaimon! Stop spilling food
all over the city!

00:13:01.176 --> 00:13:03.137
Oh, boy, that was a close shave!

00:13:05.848 --> 00:13:08.934
Huh? Which way's the station?

00:13:55.314 --> 00:13:56.065
All right!

00:14:27.930 --> 00:14:30.182
I'll be there soon, Shiro!

00:14:52.204 --> 00:14:54.790
Um... I think it was this way...

00:14:57.209 --> 00:14:58.877
Something smells good...

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:03.215
Huh? This guy...

00:15:03.632 --> 00:15:07.636
Wearing long sleeves in the summer?
Isn't he hot?

00:15:08.262 --> 00:15:09.596
Right, here you go!

00:15:19.106 --> 00:15:21.066
Eating ramen...

00:15:21.150 --> 00:15:23.152
...while sweating profusely
during the hot days of summer...

00:15:23.694 --> 00:15:26.822
There's nothing like it!

00:15:27.739 --> 00:15:31.618
Hot! But that's precisely
what makes it so delicious!

00:15:31.827 --> 00:15:33.370
What a weirdo...

00:15:34.788 --> 00:15:36.582
I don't want any, after all!

00:15:52.639 --> 00:15:54.266
Shiro...

00:15:58.604 --> 00:16:00.272
Shiro!

00:16:02.107 --> 00:16:05.444
Where are you again, Shiro?

00:16:06.612 --> 00:16:09.323
SUPERMARKET NIKO NIKO DO

00:16:13.827 --> 00:16:15.037
Maruta...

00:16:15.287 --> 00:16:17.915
You're the one who said
you wanted to lose weight.

00:16:17.956 --> 00:16:19.833
No, but you see...

00:16:19.958 --> 00:16:21.919
What's that you're
holding in your hand?

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:22.836
Oh, uh... nothing...

00:16:22.920 --> 00:16:27.132
I never should've fired that boy
with the Herculean strength.

00:16:27.633 --> 00:16:30.928
It's so busy these days,
I'd even hire a cat to help out!

00:16:30.969 --> 00:16:32.471
I'll give you a hand, so...

00:16:33.388 --> 00:16:35.641
Please give me
something good to eat.

00:16:36.767 --> 00:16:38.477
My shop is renowned for
its cleanliness!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:40.103
Now get out of my sight!

00:16:40.354 --> 00:16:43.899
But you're the one who said
you wanted to hire a cat!

00:16:49.988 --> 00:16:51.949
Oh, it's a kitty cat...

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:55.452
So cute...

00:16:58.163 --> 00:17:00.999
Daddy, can we take
this cat home with us?

00:17:01.625 --> 00:17:03.001
You mean that cat there?

00:17:03.001 --> 00:17:03.794
Yes.

00:17:04.002 --> 00:17:06.004
Are you sure you can
take good care of it?

00:17:06.213 --> 00:17:08.966
Yes, I'm gonna feed it
every single day!

00:17:09.007 --> 00:17:10.676
F-Feed me?

00:17:10.801 --> 00:17:14.137
Wait, they say you shouldn't
follow strangers home... But...

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:19.142
She doesn't look like an evil person...
And she'll feed me...

00:17:19.434 --> 00:17:21.353
I wonder what
your mother will say?

00:17:21.478 --> 00:17:26.024
Well, Miho has a cat, and so do
Kozue and Kana - they all have cats!

00:17:26.149 --> 00:17:28.527
And they dress them up
in adorable clothes...

00:17:31.029 --> 00:17:32.906
Oooh! So adorable!

00:17:33.240 --> 00:17:35.117
You look like a princess...

00:17:35.951 --> 00:17:37.744
But I'm a male!

00:17:39.204 --> 00:17:42.082
No way am I gonna
wear these frilly clothes!

00:17:45.043 --> 00:17:48.046
I came this close
to selling my soul...

00:17:49.923 --> 00:17:52.092
Where am I? I don't know this place...

00:17:56.638 --> 00:17:58.974
<i>Shire... where are you?</i>

00:18:04.146 --> 00:18:05.772
That wasn't it...

00:18:13.739 --> 00:18:15.157
I've got to go...

00:18:29.338 --> 00:18:31.673
Where the heck are you...

00:18:32.382 --> 00:18:33.717
...Shiro?

00:18:49.107 --> 00:18:50.108
This is it!

00:18:51.401 --> 00:18:52.986
Shiro!

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:55.947
<i>Shire'. Shh-o'.!</i>

00:19:02.329 --> 00:19:04.247
I finally made it here, Shiro!

00:19:08.627 --> 00:19:10.754
I was getting old
waiting for you, Kuro.

00:19:12.297 --> 00:19:14.257
Thanks for coming, Kuro!

00:19:14.299 --> 00:19:15.926
Shiro!

00:19:16.301 --> 00:19:20.055
You were taking so long to get here,
I had to get started without you.

00:19:20.097 --> 00:19:21.890
Hey, my bad!

00:19:22.307 --> 00:19:25.894
How have you been?
Rumor has it...

00:19:26.019 --> 00:19:28.146
...that you're living
with Rin now, huh?

00:19:28.271 --> 00:19:32.859
That's right. But listen to this -
I tried to eat some sukiyaki yesterday,

00:19:32.901 --> 00:19:36.321
What? Sukiyaki?
I haven't had that in such a long time...

00:19:36.655 --> 00:19:37.989
Neither have I!

00:19:38.073 --> 00:19:42.160
But that Rin... he took advantage
of the fact that I can't eat hot food,

00:19:42.285 --> 00:19:45.205
and tried to eat up all the sukiyaki
while I was burning my tongue.

00:19:45.330 --> 00:19:46.540
Can you believe that?

00:19:46.665 --> 00:19:49.918
I was so mad,
I thought I'd get Yukio to yell at him,

00:19:50.043 --> 00:19:54.131
but that Yukio has such a one-track mind,
I didn't get anywhere with him!

00:19:54.172 --> 00:19:56.258
Well, you have a right
to be pissed!

00:19:56.341 --> 00:19:59.511
After all, they say that grudges over meat
can last for seven generations.

00:20:00.053 --> 00:20:02.347
But who knew that even
with cram school classes,

00:20:02.472 --> 00:20:04.683
he still hasn't realized
something as important as that.

00:20:04.975 --> 00:20:06.977
Rin sure is a piece of work.

00:20:08.061 --> 00:20:11.398
Really, he acts like a child,
and I'm so tired of it.

00:20:11.648 --> 00:20:15.444
And when he gets pissed,
he bursts into flames like an instant water heater!

00:20:19.072 --> 00:20:25.704
Kuro... The thing is, I'm really,
really grateful to you, you know!

00:20:26.705 --> 00:20:29.332
Here you are,
a demon for over a hundred years,

00:20:29.416 --> 00:20:32.711
and yet you're willing
to humor a newbie like Rin...

00:20:33.628 --> 00:20:38.008
That kid is blessed, having a
dependable veteran like you by his side!

00:20:38.425 --> 00:20:40.844
Dependable? Really?

00:20:41.219 --> 00:20:44.139
Damn right!
Look after Rin for me, will you?

00:20:44.222 --> 00:20:46.391
Sure! You can count on me!

00:20:47.184 --> 00:20:48.351
<i>Shh-o'?</i>

00:20:48.560 --> 00:20:50.395
You take care of yourself...

00:20:50.687 --> 00:20:52.731
<i>Okay. You, too, Shire'.!</i>

00:20:57.235 --> 00:20:58.278
So long!

00:21:06.244 --> 00:21:08.580
See you again, Shiro...

00:21:19.966 --> 00:21:21.259
<i>Shh-o'?</i>

00:21:32.687 --> 00:21:36.358
You took way too long
visiting the old man.

00:21:36.775 --> 00:21:39.110
Your sukiyaki's about to rot.

00:21:39.194 --> 00:21:41.947
Huh? You mean there's still
some left for me?

00:21:42.030 --> 00:21:45.116
Damn right there is.
I set some aside for you.

00:21:45.283 --> 00:21:47.285
You just don't know
how to take a joke.

00:21:47.410 --> 00:21:48.954
You really are a dope!

00:21:49.412 --> 00:21:50.622
Rin...

00:21:51.039 --> 00:21:56.586
Well, dinner was a real bust
without you around... I admit it.

00:21:58.421 --> 00:22:00.090
At the end of the clay...

00:22:06.638 --> 00:22:08.640
At the end of day, for me...

00:22:10.058 --> 00:22:12.477
<i>Rh“!</i>

00:22:13.520 --> 00:22:15.772
You're the best, Rin!

00:22:16.314 --> 00:22:17.941
Pwned!

00:22:24.030 --> 00:22:27.033
Kimi to deatta no wa
It is not by chance

00:22:27.617 --> 00:22:30.620
tada no guuzen janai
that I met you

00:22:31.204 --> 00:22:36.418
Kore wo unmei to yobunda
This is so-called destiny

00:22:38.378 --> 00:22:41.381
Sono hitomi ni utsuru
In order for us to keep

00:22:42.132 --> 00:22:44.759
bokutachi ga kagayaite
shining in your eyes

00:22:45.135 --> 00:22:48.221
Irareru youni zutto
Let's keep looking

00:22:48.513 --> 00:22:50.682
mitsume tsuzukete
at each other

00:22:51.057 --> 00:22:54.352
PLEASE BE - dakara moshi kono mune ga
PLEASE BE - If my heart

00:22:54.644 --> 00:22:59.274
WITH ME - michi ni mayou hi ni wa
WITH ME - gets lost one day

00:22:59.566 --> 00:23:05.113
Mirai he no tobira wo hiraite hoshii
I want you to open the door to the future

00:23:05.447 --> 00:23:08.283
Ready, ready ready for the take off

00:23:08.575 --> 00:23:11.536
Michi naru sekai he to
Let's fly out

00:23:11.870 --> 00:23:14.080
mai agarunda
to the unknown future

00:23:14.372 --> 00:23:19.544
Dakara sono te hanasanaide - BUDDY
So don't let go of my hand BUDDY

00:23:19.878 --> 00:23:22.547
Ready, ready ready for the take off

00:23:22.881 --> 00:23:26.092
Yume ga mezasu basho he
To the place where dreams are headed

00:23:26.384 --> 00:23:30.347
tsukanda kono kizuna
Clasping our bond tightly

00:23:30.639 --> 00:23:34.309
nigiri shimete
in our hands

00:23:34.601 --> 00:23:37.520
Ready, ready ready for the take off

00:23:37.854 --> 00:23:40.523
Yume ga mezasu basho he
To the place where dreams are headed

00:23:40.857 --> 00:23:44.903
tenishita kono kizuna
Clasping our bond tightly

00:23:45.278 --> 00:23:49.407
nigiri shimete
in our hands
